# Zac AI - Environment Variable Template
#
# This file lists variable NAMES only. Never put a real secret value here.
# See SECRETS.md for the full policy.
#
# Real secrets live in:
#   - .env.development (gitignored) for local development/test credentials
#   - macOS Keychain for real production/runtime credentials
# No plaintext .env.production file is ever used for real credentials.
#
# Every variable name carries a trust-boundary prefix (DECISIONS.md D017):
#   PERSONAL_   - Zac's personal data/services
#   BRAINSTORM_ - Brainstorm company data/services
#   SHARED_     - infrastructure common to both boundaries
#
# Entries are added below only when a specific, approved integration or
# component actually requires the credential. None exist yet, because no
# integration has been approved and wired up (see D017; ROADMAP.md Phase 1).

# ---- PERSONAL ----
# (none yet - add PERSONAL_<SERVICE>_<CREDENTIAL> here once a personal
# integration is approved and implemented)

# ---- BRAINSTORM ----
# (none yet - add BRAINSTORM_<SERVICE>_<CREDENTIAL> here once a Brainstorm
# integration is approved and implemented)

# ---- SHARED ----
# (none yet - add SHARED_<SERVICE>_<CREDENTIAL> here once a shared
# component, e.g. a model provider, is approved and implemented)
#
# Illustrative naming pattern only (do not uncomment - no such credential
# exists or is approved yet):
# SHARED_EXAMPLE_API_KEY=
